A* search algorithm implemented in Python.

The search module runs on Python 3 and has no third-party dependencies.
Add src to your Python import path to import astar.

Run the regression tests from the repository root:

    python -m unittest discover -s tests -v

The interactive demo requires curses and a terminal with at least 24 rows
and 79 columns. On Linux or macOS, run:

    python src/astar_demo.py
